WEBVTT

00:00.234 --> 00:05.695
As for the dream-filled Tomorrow,

00:05.873 --> 00:11.106
No one can see it...

00:13.347 --> 00:18.979
I close my eyes and think of you,

00:19.553 --> 00:25.389
Who I'll meet someday...

00:25.626 --> 00:31.861
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:32.132 --> 00:38.560
Show the spring to these eyes of mine.

00:38.806 --> 00:44.938
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:45.346 --> 00:51.546
Farewell to the city in winter.

00:51.919 --> 00:58.154
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:58.492 --> 01:04.829
Call the spring to my heart.

01:04.999 --> 01:11.461
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

01:11.505 --> 01:18.377
Farewell, snow flakes.

01:33.027 --> 01:36.063
So then, they're
both still trainees!

01:36.063 --> 01:39.299
Right. Angela is
suspended for one week.

01:39.299 --> 01:43.133
Inoue-kun was not officially reprimanded,
but he voluntarily suspended himself.

01:43.904 --> 01:46.964
Master Chief Ginpun settled
the matter with the media.

01:47.875 --> 01:49.240
That's great!

01:55.916 --> 01:59.019
Hello. Oyamada Office
of Mage Labor.

01:59.019 --> 02:01.487
Um, may I ask who's calling?

02:02.923 --> 02:05.949
Uh! Councilor Furusaki!

02:10.764 --> 02:14.825
Certainly, Kikuchi-kun was not
at fault in the Tokyo Tower case.

02:15.002 --> 02:19.166
However, she did not report Angela's
illegal action and simply watched her.

02:19.540 --> 02:21.775
Now, don't you think that's also
a violation of the mage code?

02:21.775 --> 02:24.835
I'm sorry for
my lack of supervision.

02:27.214 --> 02:31.844
However, it is my job to protect
trainees of great promise.

02:33.854 --> 02:38.518
It was I who made the decision
not to punish Kikuchi Yume-kun.

02:40.861 --> 02:42.329
Was that excessive?

02:42.329 --> 02:46.026
No. Thank you very much.

02:46.433 --> 02:50.699
Don't mention it, as long as
you return the favor...

02:51.538 --> 02:54.371
What do you mean?

02:54.608 --> 02:58.908
With your Special Power,
Oyamada-kun, shall we make it even?

03:00.180 --> 03:02.205
With your Special Power,
Oyamada-kun, right?

03:07.387 --> 03:12.848
"Yume and a Girl and a Summer Seed"

03:16.430 --> 03:20.389
These aren't real flowing noodles,
but more like circling noodles.

03:23.804 --> 03:25.066
What's wrong?

03:25.305 --> 03:29.332
I was told to interview
the applicant today all by myself.

03:29.910 --> 03:31.741
Whoa! That's great!

03:31.845 --> 03:35.415
We're getting ready to give
the finishing touch to my training.

03:35.415 --> 03:37.975
Good luck, Master Mage Yume!

03:39.653 --> 03:41.211
I'm getting nervous!

03:51.098 --> 03:52.199
Come on!

03:52.199 --> 03:57.271
Well, I'm asking if you'd
prefer barley tea or iced coffee.

03:57.271 --> 03:58.932
I can get it myself!

03:59.773 --> 04:03.265
Ok, ok! I'll stay with you
and help you out.

04:03.777 --> 04:04.945
Kera-san!

04:04.945 --> 04:06.071
Uh, what?

04:06.280 --> 04:09.078
Your staying with me
is not allowed.

04:09.149 --> 04:14.087
I must respect the applicant's
confidentiality and obey the rules.

04:14.087 --> 04:15.452
That is not true.

04:16.790 --> 04:18.485
What's not true?

04:18.625 --> 04:21.788
As much as you might
act as deputy for my boss,

04:22.229 --> 04:24.697
what's the applicant
gonna think?

04:24.765 --> 04:28.468
You think they want to
discuss things with a kid?

04:28.468 --> 04:30.204
Why do you say that?

04:30.204 --> 04:34.141
If I'm with you, you're still a deputy
and a kid... but have an assistant!

04:34.141 --> 04:37.338
That's a big deal and will
make the applicant feel safer.

04:38.145 --> 04:40.272
Make the applicant feel safer...

04:42.082 --> 04:43.674
Uh, yes!

04:44.318 --> 04:45.615
Excuse me.

04:56.597 --> 05:01.330
Without so much as leaving a note,
my father disappeared five days ago.

05:02.069 --> 05:04.833
And you've already looked
everywhere you could think of, right?

05:05.005 --> 05:06.996
Of course I have.

05:07.507 --> 05:13.714
I spoke with the police, too,
but they didn't listen very well.

05:13.714 --> 05:17.284
But I can't just
not do anything.

05:17.284 --> 05:18.649
So, I came here.

05:19.286 --> 05:20.446
Is that so?

05:21.088 --> 05:25.218
Please! Search for my father.
If we can't find him, I'll...

05:26.226 --> 05:29.423
I'll do my very best.

05:30.097 --> 05:31.724
Welcome.

05:31.832 --> 05:33.823
Um, who is this?

05:34.134 --> 05:36.125
My... assistant.

05:37.104 --> 05:38.469
Kera is my name.

05:39.706 --> 05:44.700
Is that so? You're still in training,
but have an assistant? Impressive!

05:44.978 --> 05:47.640
Uh, yes...

05:55.155 --> 05:56.490
Casa Furusaki

05:56.490 --> 05:59.893
Wow, what a huge condo complex!

05:59.893 --> 06:01.861
How many of my apartments
would fit in there?

06:02.462 --> 06:05.832
Our house and garden
used to be here.

06:05.832 --> 06:07.800
It must have
been a big mansion.

06:12.372 --> 06:17.071
Now Father's unit is here on the
first floor, and mine is on the third.

06:21.748 --> 06:22.737
Father!

06:23.684 --> 06:26.778
Father, where have you been?

06:27.287 --> 06:30.256
Nanako-san,
did your father come home?

06:36.129 --> 06:38.732
I asked you to listen
carefully to her,

06:38.732 --> 06:41.701
but I did not ask you
to take a mage action.

06:41.868 --> 06:43.529
I'm sorry.

06:44.171 --> 06:48.164
Yume's always only concerned with
what's in front of her. But, Boss...

06:49.242 --> 06:54.111
when she sees someone in trouble,
it seems she can't refrain from helping.

06:56.616 --> 06:59.244
That's what's great
about Yume, right?

06:59.319 --> 07:04.124
You're right. By the way,
why are you here, Kera?

07:04.124 --> 07:07.059
Um, that's...
There were various reasons.

07:07.327 --> 07:09.295
I tagged along
with her on my own.

07:11.798 --> 07:14.460
What?
My uncle asked you?

07:14.768 --> 07:20.229
Yes. Um, you didn't know that
the councilor made a request of me?

07:20.907 --> 07:21.896
No.

07:23.043 --> 07:26.877
"I see. He is secretive
with his own family, too."

07:26.980 --> 07:31.974
I had no idea.
He told me not to do anything.

07:32.652 --> 07:36.645
The councilor was very
concerned about this case.

07:36.923 --> 07:40.290
Concerned?
Concerned about what?

07:45.832 --> 07:48.494
Maybe he just moved...

07:48.568 --> 07:53.062
And maybe the problem is
that he moved without telling her.

07:56.109 --> 07:57.098
Kera-san?

07:59.646 --> 08:01.637
Just about empty...

08:02.048 --> 08:05.848
Kera-san!
Have you been over here?

08:06.553 --> 08:08.077
No, I haven't!

08:14.027 --> 08:15.187
Whoa...

08:21.935 --> 08:23.698
Ah!

08:25.372 --> 08:26.361
What was that?

08:31.011 --> 08:33.002
In a place like this?

08:36.416 --> 08:37.542
Ahh!

08:41.221 --> 08:42.222
- Did you find something?

08:42.222 --> 08:43.056
- Did you find something?
- Uh!

08:43.056 --> 08:45.718
What is it? Huh?

08:47.327 --> 08:49.318
Your flyaways are gone!

08:49.396 --> 08:51.159
What?

08:53.633 --> 08:57.729
My father and uncle are real brothers,
but they don't get along very well...

08:59.873 --> 09:01.741
You're right.

09:01.741 --> 09:03.944
My flyaways are gone.

09:03.944 --> 09:06.012
I had them yesterday
and this morning.

09:06.012 --> 09:07.843
Huh?
Yesterday and this morning...

09:08.582 --> 09:10.150
Yume-chan,
what are you doing?

09:10.150 --> 09:11.351
Huh?

09:11.351 --> 09:14.343
Well, there's no clue.

09:14.421 --> 09:17.424
I know. I've looked through
the entire place, as well.

09:17.424 --> 09:19.051
Sensei...

09:19.426 --> 09:21.328
About the Special Power
for this case...

09:21.328 --> 09:24.263
What if we use Special Power
to extract memories from things?

09:24.865 --> 09:27.857
Memories from things?
But this room has...

09:28.268 --> 09:29.257
Ah!

09:29.302 --> 09:32.931
Yes. I think this mirror
saw everything.

09:45.318 --> 09:47.309
"With all my precious feelings
in my heart..."

09:52.692 --> 09:54.922
Five nights ago...

10:15.215 --> 10:17.183
Who's that girl?

10:17.183 --> 10:18.343
That girl?

10:19.185 --> 10:21.016
The one who just
dropped the sock.

10:21.054 --> 10:23.723
There's no one
there but my father.

10:23.723 --> 10:25.657
What are you
talking about, Yume?

10:25.825 --> 10:27.725
Was I mistaken?

10:28.395 --> 10:29.657
I was mistaken!

10:31.398 --> 10:32.465
- Ah! That girl!

10:32.465 --> 10:33.466
- Ah! That girl!
- That girl?

10:33.466 --> 10:35.525
Yume-chan,
what's been bothering you?

10:36.336 --> 10:38.327
Ah! The property deed!

10:38.672 --> 10:40.663
I knew it!
You took it with you!

10:41.074 --> 10:43.710
Where'd you go
with the property deed?

10:43.710 --> 10:44.836
Come on, Father!

10:45.078 --> 10:47.774
How horrible of you to
monopolize the family assets!

10:50.283 --> 10:52.080
Yume-chan!
Stop your mage action!

10:52.118 --> 10:54.109
What?
Uh... um... Yes!

10:54.487 --> 10:56.990
Where did you go?
Tell me!

10:56.990 --> 10:58.058
Yume-chan!

10:58.058 --> 10:59.992
Stop your mage action!
Get ahold of yourself!

11:00.060 --> 11:01.687
Uh, yes!

11:23.416 --> 11:27.716
Father has always been selfish.
My late mother had so much trouble.

11:27.787 --> 11:31.691
Father loved the house and
garden we used to have here.

11:31.691 --> 11:34.194
But Mother passed away,

11:34.194 --> 11:37.631
and it was too difficult to
maintain for just the two of us.

11:37.631 --> 11:41.568
I strongly suggested that
we build this condo complex.

11:41.568 --> 11:44.628
But Father kept talking
about our old beloved house...

11:45.472 --> 11:48.464
I scolded him for holding a grudge,
and it turned into a big fight.

11:49.009 --> 11:52.206
So, your father moved out
on his own free will, right?

11:52.879 --> 11:57.373
Yes. Without telling me, and with
the property deed. I can't forgive him.

11:57.684 --> 12:00.676
I wonder why he took
the property deed...

12:00.787 --> 12:04.090
I'm sure it's because he doesn't
want to give it to me.

12:04.090 --> 12:09.062
I grew up in that house,
and I was attached to it, too.

12:09.062 --> 12:11.462
But life's needs come first.

12:12.966 --> 12:16.302
I, too, am living on the piece of land
my grandfather gave me.

12:16.302 --> 12:17.462
What?

12:17.537 --> 12:19.528
I built a sa-ru-sa (salsa) club on it.

12:20.140 --> 12:21.129
Sa-ru (monkey)?

12:22.142 --> 12:24.770
Please come visit me
someday.

12:28.882 --> 12:30.717
Four bottles
of barley tea, please!

12:30.717 --> 12:32.742
Ah! That rolled sushi
looks good!

12:33.620 --> 12:37.784
I don't feel like going
back to that haunted room.

12:43.129 --> 12:44.790
Do you want
some ice cream?

12:45.865 --> 12:49.130
But is it ok to give
ice cream to a cat?

12:52.539 --> 12:53.972
Huh?

12:59.646 --> 13:01.314
- What is it?

13:01.314 --> 13:02.615
- What is it?
- Pocket...

13:02.615 --> 13:03.980
Ahh!

13:08.154 --> 13:09.143
Pocket.

13:09.522 --> 13:10.819
Pocket?

13:14.360 --> 13:15.827
Huh? When in the world?

13:16.930 --> 13:18.921
The seeds from earlier...

13:20.100 --> 13:22.168
He particularly
likes these flowers.

13:22.168 --> 13:23.829
What?

13:24.504 --> 13:25.835
This one knows.

13:26.172 --> 13:27.161
This one?

13:47.527 --> 13:50.860
Huh? What are these?

13:57.670 --> 13:59.539
- Let me see!
- You're IT next!

13:59.539 --> 14:00.665
Let me play, too!

14:40.747 --> 14:41.805
Just now that was...

14:44.851 --> 14:47.376
A man has fallen!
Oh, no!

14:52.358 --> 14:54.349
Hey, Yume!
Where are you going?

14:55.061 --> 14:56.323
My change, please. Hurry!

15:07.407 --> 15:10.774
Yes, this is it!
This is the place I just saw.

15:19.953 --> 15:21.284
There he is!

15:39.806 --> 15:41.967
Yume!
What are you doing?

15:42.642 --> 15:46.976
Kera-san! He's hurt!
There's an injured man!

15:52.318 --> 15:53.649
Could this man be...

15:53.953 --> 15:57.889
Furusaki-san?
Are you Furusaki Jiro-san?

15:58.391 --> 16:00.916
Uh-huh...

16:02.629 --> 16:03.391
- Uh!
- Uh!

16:04.330 --> 16:06.666
I'll call an ambulance!

16:06.666 --> 16:07.792
Please.

16:09.836 --> 16:13.431
Get ahold of yourself.
Hang in there!

16:19.545 --> 16:20.534
You...

16:22.181 --> 16:26.519
I don't like a condo
like that, either.

16:26.519 --> 16:30.683
Even if it's really small,
I like a house with lots of nature.

16:32.025 --> 16:33.515
What are you talking about?

16:35.528 --> 16:36.995
Thank you.

16:46.372 --> 16:50.365
They're here!
This way! Over here!

17:00.053 --> 17:01.854
What's wrong?
You look dazed.

17:01.854 --> 17:03.981
Huh? Oh, nothing...

17:09.595 --> 17:14.000
The property deed
was left with an attorney.

17:14.000 --> 17:19.666
Father was going to buy a house
in Oku-tama and live by himself.

17:19.739 --> 17:24.711
But before he could tell me that,
we got into that big fight...

17:24.711 --> 17:26.941
Then how did he end up
at such a place?

17:27.513 --> 17:29.572
Apparently, he got terribly drunk...

17:30.083 --> 17:31.550
And he got lost.

17:31.918 --> 17:32.942
Yes.

17:33.586 --> 17:36.923
He took a bad fall,
and broke a few bones,

17:36.923 --> 17:39.425
but nothing
is life-threatening.

17:39.425 --> 17:41.586
More importantly, he's safe.

17:43.296 --> 17:45.059
We've caused you
so much trouble.

17:47.467 --> 17:51.198
Kikuchi-san, thank you
so much for finding my father.

17:51.537 --> 17:53.528
Oh, it was nothing...

17:54.340 --> 17:56.865
Great idea, using the mirror
in your mage action.

17:57.944 --> 17:58.933
It was just a fluke.

17:59.946 --> 18:03.939
I know you will become
a wonderful mage.

18:05.118 --> 18:06.642
Thank you very much!

18:17.797 --> 18:20.095
Thank you
for your hard work.

18:21.100 --> 18:24.971
It's absolutely embarrassing.
Please keep this confidential.

18:24.971 --> 18:25.960
Yes, sir.

18:27.340 --> 18:28.408
Kikuchi-kun...

18:28.408 --> 18:29.204
Yes, sir.

18:30.576 --> 18:33.312
Thank you.
You did a very good job.

18:33.312 --> 18:34.313
Not at all.

18:34.313 --> 18:37.950
I hear that your mage action
was excellent.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.281
Very good. Very good.

18:40.153 --> 18:42.246
Keep up your good work.

18:42.989 --> 18:44.320
Yes.

18:44.991 --> 18:46.754
Councilor?

18:48.594 --> 18:51.028
I found this in
your brother's room.

18:52.031 --> 18:58.171
When you refer to someone else's brother,
speak in a respectful manner!

18:58.171 --> 19:01.470
I found this in Councilor Furusaki's
Honorable Brother's room.

19:08.514 --> 19:10.004
You may be excused.

19:12.018 --> 19:17.183
Most excellent trainee Kikuchi-kun,
you have a very bright future.

19:29.202 --> 19:35.539
"When I was little, our garden
was full of sunflowers in summer..."

19:47.687 --> 19:51.088
I've never been praised that much
for my mage action.

19:51.224 --> 19:55.058
It was the first time I've seen
Councilor Furusaki praise anyone.

19:55.962 --> 19:56.951
Sensei?

19:57.096 --> 19:58.085
Yes?

20:00.466 --> 20:03.765
I'm glad I came
for mage training.

20:04.337 --> 20:06.805
I'm happy I'm able
to use Special Power.

20:07.373 --> 20:09.500
I'm just so happy every day.

20:12.612 --> 20:13.601
Yeah!

20:23.322 --> 20:28.761
Speaking of which, how did you
find Furusaki-san? Special Power?

20:28.761 --> 20:30.763
No. Um, well...

20:30.763 --> 20:34.255
There was a little girl and...
a cat, and that...

20:35.868 --> 20:37.426
I have no idea what
you're talking about.

20:38.604 --> 20:44.110
She said she liked nature and stuff.
Then she just disappeared.

20:44.110 --> 20:45.873
She was a mysterious little girl.

20:46.445 --> 20:49.573
Anyway, the credit goes to you.

20:49.649 --> 20:51.284
- Not really...

20:51.284 --> 20:52.216
- Not really...
- Uh!

20:53.619 --> 20:54.608
Yo!

20:56.689 --> 20:59.125
Boss. He told me
to get to the bar.

20:59.125 --> 21:00.615
Work hard!

21:00.693 --> 21:01.682
Ok.

21:03.129 --> 21:04.931
Yume, wanna come, too?

21:04.931 --> 21:07.456
For your reward, I'll teach you
how to salsa tonight!

21:09.135 --> 21:10.932
Yeah, I'll go!

21:11.137 --> 21:14.800
All right. Let's go!
But first we have to clean up.

21:15.141 --> 21:16.403
Aye-aye, sir!

21:20.479 --> 21:27.112
When I turn around, it's still there,

21:29.956 --> 21:36.384
The future I've been pursuing.

21:38.197 --> 21:47.299
I have something precious in my heart.

21:47.440 --> 21:52.036
Upon the still unseen blue and

21:53.079 --> 22:00.076
The floating clouds, I wished...

22:02.855 --> 22:04.914
Under the Blue Sky

22:05.157 --> 22:11.995
From that dream that we dreamed that day,

22:12.231 --> 22:18.727
Let's not wake up, and let's not stop...

22:21.540 --> 22:23.976
Under the Blue Sky

22:23.976 --> 22:30.575
Let's keep shining and moving on.

22:31.117 --> 22:37.147
The endless journey continues...

22:49.902 --> 22:52.305
PREVIEW

22:52.305 --> 22:53.773
Educational Psychology

22:53.773 --> 22:55.263
Educational Psychology
Hope for the future...

22:56.075 --> 22:58.566
Struggle with reality...

22:58.711 --> 23:00.413
Confusion...

23:00.413 --> 23:02.081
Doubt...

23:02.081 --> 23:03.883
Pain...

23:03.883 --> 23:05.818
Sorrow...

23:05.818 --> 23:08.821
My wishes are...

23:08.821 --> 23:11.023
My thoughts are...

23:11.023 --> 23:13.253
My heart is...

23:13.826 --> 23:17.430
"The Destination of Special Power"
The next episode, Episode 10,
is "The Destination of Special Power."

23:17.430 --> 23:19.728
"The Destination of Special Power"
I hope you look forward to it!
